  m_text: '- Defeat enemies and destroy buildings to earn experience.


    - Each
    level offers random stat upgrades. Choose one.


    - Each new level requires
    more experience.


    - The upgrade menu opens when you level up and closes
    after you choose an upgrade.


    - Hold the left mouse button on an upgrade
    to select it.'
