  m_text: '- Move the robot with WASD.


    - Shooting is automatic and targets
    enemies.


    - Press Esc to pause.


    - Press Space near the shop to open
    it. Find it on the map.


    - Press Space again to close the shop. It also
    closes automatically after a purchase.'
